sequenceDiagram
    title Sequence 2/2: Background jobs and private files
    participant user
    participant gateway
    participant pg
    participant redis
    participant worker
    participant store
    worker->>redis: Consume job ID from queue
    worker->>pg: Claim job; check tenant/version/policy
    pg-->>worker: Job manifest + snapshot reference
    worker->>worker: Calculate, build XLSX, validate
    worker->>store: Save private file + content hash
    store-->>worker: Artifact ID
    worker->>pg: Record completion + file metadata
    user->>gateway: Web app polls job status
    gateway->>pg: Read status by tenant/actor
    pg-->>gateway: Authorized job result
    gateway-->>user: Show downloadable file
    user->>gateway: Download by artifact ID
    gateway->>store: Check access/expiry; read file
    store-->>gateway: File bytes
    gateway-->>user: Stream file to user
